{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review follow-up for your #10 commit (PR #24). Same fence and rules as before. Do not delegate further. Make one new commit (no amend) ending `Co-Authored-By: Muse Spark 1.3 <noreply@opencode.ai>`; do not push.\n\n1. P1 `cancel` (src/cli.rs ~453): before any signal, confirm the record's supervisorPid is still THIS job's supervisor. Check `ps -o command= -p <pid>` contains `__supervise <id>`. If the process is missing or the command doesn't match, call `write_cancelled` directly without signalling anything.\n2. `resume`: if the `supersededBy` rewrite of A fails after B has spawned, still print B's id, warn on stderr, exit 0.\n3. Collapse the duplicated unknown-model error in `resume` into one path that reuses `run`'s message.\n4. Drop the CANCELLED/STALLED arms from `RunStatus::parse` if nothing needs them, and fix the doc comment. If something does need them, keep them and add an output.rs test that an agent line `STATUS: CANCELLED` does not set CANCELLED.\n5. Add an e2e test for the SIGKILL fallback: SIGSTOP the supervisor, run `cancel`, assert CANCELLED is written within about 6s and the agent and its grandchild are gone.\n6. Simplify:\n   - one `wait_for_terminal_record(id, timeout)` helper instead of the two poll loops\n   - build `write_cancelled` by mutating `prior`, like `write_supervisor_died`\n   - in the tests, replace `gone` with the existing `alive`\n   - remove the `ps` child scan if the e2e tests (including the new SIGKILL test) pass without it; keep it only if one fails, and say which\n\nBefore committing, run `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` and `cargo test`. Check that `pgrep -fl \"delegate __supervise|agent.sh\"` prints nothing.\n\nReport: commit SHA, test counts, and for item 6's last point whether the `ps` scan stayed and why. Then Friction (up to 3 bullets), then a STATUS line.\n\nEnd your final message with a single trailing line that is exactly one of: STATUS: DONE, STATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS, STATUS: BLOCKED, STATUS: NEEDS_CONTEXT, or STATUS: ERROR. When you need an answer from the orchestrator before you can proceed, put your question in the message body and end with STATUS: NEEDS_CONTEXT."}],"timestamp":1790850804780},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_6abe36f6c07568d6ed9e4d7a:rs_01a0f706b1b37540bd5dd03f1b66a0af\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"encrypted_content\":\"Q-PaDgGlyRWnQ6-ZzQjxFCPCHeB5BjLLAQL4zb9xQjhDWdLM3AU8ld99CruXD2Nnf_nnKx0sxSetpU1xD6p3fDUcb74SuPSrC-4kZLWz_kGXJbw_R1Ic4VQp8bUzs6y3yz29GEO3qMARTa66oTCtBO119OUb6eP5VdB59SWP-QTpA2cpBwG___mYxWEOP_aI-bU2wmOVGibsGeSvnelJ6Oc_7OQLFj1sZYZDuBtEj3qaTuPasc2orbcCmUvu7Y0xFTuoAOLhaXQE5q04FixFSWTpbxj4Rv8xyi035XyOxY3BBKFmzQAHPK0xC2n3Q-5zBUV1CwUXZNf4J-sNDqrBopuhGB9jg4_HhKnU48E5cX2hYjIv76n8UnX18m20wdpUV4P7iFg3BYHt_gD3JOCXpmAeOH3msPg46fo6aO5M2WGkKGJNQd2Na6UxWCkrqSMKzWbd3Ml4Bna5zWd6h5dqIwiIhWsYLLalOWVMw4FLhLdzw5cKbJ6FHsrlnfFkEbghHZjOj3RmRHvLr7dhIra8EnekI7VfW_R8e50cxSfZXG_puR4O4Q7o-D8fMt8WPOi_jp2t0z98nkObR-pbzvSvZXNMe2L-CtFvplT6OTtFJoLD4jdxD2xvthFFk0Zqb-_AuGep3mc6oINuW7zHmlzir8swubXQzC-P5Xi3ru2A5QICm7l9uq3CRogQma4IUohOO2c5TL6Zjb92tsQgIAhFq6odMo6Ty0VBxMW16miXKTmSWNBAeYpnIgktOFlV0AJtUov_lwmF1SWuuvshmTJI3SDg4EfUzoZ_AehowvJHnnxH7JhCxIfZx5a_xlTZnsR5N3xuiolDUvJYO6d2jwHIJDljTV2q5IZdv2f6pm_fTLlb8stX_Tnj4Bj5uuFNI-Ooy-AZS6oRvZN04UV61KWeMn741TBrEhFtNVJrXR3QRDu8j89WQW1uTxnCW-Z0WghmX9oI-Bb5-loY_zB5gEIG5qqsycape8UWgvVGnygjYQ9WeuBByZkAj5k3om_buOiAH_uNjNWh0a3KI1IZ38qpmoeYePVXZmxyLGEq0sJre6lEFpDhd9acsT7OnKqfXtI6fsZrC1IfpHB79aRgxvxbFAnDDg1olWyH9nGpXfMbnp5z5GfA1edKY9PhPI3nGQfa4bkqIKF7NZBKHOwIugE-41m-LSYr0RxGMSqakDnkI3qhAVhsRpv_tdo_dcBFaE_QW1NY5utiGuudcIBZ3vYNoOOrFEzaSUYo0ytqG0S33P9oKgbgCW4rJWJ3GjJgFzg8dbA3AMCbVk02ZC6xLkqB0PTrObvWPal747IAh6wFOslUOcchPC8kAgzYze5gNxv6K5e02RIgxj62648dskDVgy6bVEIJ4DeEUGsRW7m7qOAslZHfBfCEYJQeAKxp2TPnSgetSvMYcgxyM308nw\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"thinking","think