PXYwDRwLmjvBhko8bwS9qqiqd9ypEGr7VJiNSM3gx2M-aUcjgPF2fBaQ6DYMb83BZ53fmwbfBt-LMp08fsIjzGSfrMGpJTT3KkX9rjr5nRJpI_1-0RlVFB7PjNY_HfpGJQ\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01a0f70d15717691b88aa5d400fa1521|fc_01a0f70d15717691b88aa5d400fa1521","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-10-resume-cancel && git branch --show-current && git status --short && git add src/cli.rs src/status_record.rs src/types.rs src/output.rs tests/cli_e2e.rs && git commit -m \"fix: review follow-ups on resume and cancel (#10)\n\ncancel verifies the record's supervisorPid is still this job's\nsupervisor (ps shows __supervise <id>) before signalling; a missing or\nrecycled pid writes CANCELLED directly without signalling anything.\n\nresume still prints the new job id with exit 0 when the supersededBy\nlink fails, warning on stderr instead. The duplicated unknown-model\nerror in resume collapses into run's message via one helper.\n\nRunStatus::parse drops the CANCELLED/STALLED arms nothing needs\n(deserialization keeps them for stored records); an output.rs test pins\nthat an agent STATUS: CANCELLED line never sets CANCELLED.\n\nA new e2e test covers the SIGKILL fallback: with the supervisor\nSIGSTOPped, cancel waits out the 5s, SIGKILLs both process groups and\nwrites CANCELLED itself, and the agent plus its grandchild are gone.\n\nSimplify: one wait_for_terminal_record helper, write_cancelled mutates\na copy of prior like write_supervisor_died, and the tests reuse alive.\nThe ps child scan stays: without it the SIGKILL test fails (orphaned\nagent and its sleep grandchild survive), while the fast-path test\npasses either way since registry.cancel kills the agent's group.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Muse Spark 1.3 <noreply@opencode.ai>\" && git log --oneline -3 && git status --short","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"opencode-go","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","usage":{"input":675,"output":503,"cacheRead":165873,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":64,"totalTokens":167051,"cost":{"input":0.0000675,"output":0.0001006,"cacheRead":0.000331746,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.000499846}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1790851222857,"responseId":"resp_6abe3897c06e3be2c09748de","rawStopReason":"completed","thinkingLevel":"high"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01a0f70d15717691b88aa5d400fa1521|fc_01a0f70d15717691b88aa5d400fa1521","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"10-resume-cancel\n M src/cli.rs\n M src/output.rs\n M src/status_record.rs\n M src/types.rs\n M tests/cli_e2e.rs\n[10-resume-cancel 17e0899] fix: review follow-ups on resume and cancel (#10)\n 5 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 91 deletions(-)\n17e0899 fix: review follow-ups on resume and cancel (#10)\nc4d324c feat: delegate resume and cancel (#10)\n32f6424 feat: gate, change-set, idle watchdog and cwd write lock (#9) (#23)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1790851229707},{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"opencode-go","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1790851229709,"errorMessage":"opencode-go API error (429): {\"code\":\"rate_limit_exceeded\",\"message\":\"Rate limit exceeded. Please retry after a brief wait.\",\"param\":null,\"type\":\"rate_limit_error\"}","thinkingLevel":"high"}],"willRetry":true}
